    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1321,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "演過充滿理想主義的政客",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1323,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "當過記者",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1324,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "接著眼而幽則倒",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1325,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "一九八零年凡夫蘇子獲得最佳導演",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1328,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "而他戲外最令人讚許的",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1330,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "是創辦以扶植年輕導演",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1332,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "獨立電影的日舞影展",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1334,
    "duration": 12,
    "text": "衛報指出儘管日舞影展",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1346,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "也曾被批評",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1347,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "其實有商業考量",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1349,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "被大片公司或明星定位所影響",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1351,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "但勞勃瑞福的野心跟想像力",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1354,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "仍被認為是超越了他自己",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1356,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "卓越演藝事業的一部分",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1358,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "而他對電影界的長久貢獻",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1360,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "所獲得的歷史地位",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1362,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "不只是在大螢幕上",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1363,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "也在螢幕之外",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1364,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "留下了深遠的影響",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1366,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "公視新聞黃元琳編譯",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1369,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "關心天氣",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1370,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "氣象署今天持續發佈高溫資訊",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1373,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "大臺北桃園局部",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1376,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "都有可能來到三十七度以上",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1379,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "而中午過後",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1380,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "桃園以南容易出現局部短暫",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1383,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "雷震雨",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1385,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "山區的降雨機率更高",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1387,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "前往山區活動的朋友",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1389,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "務必也要留意天氣資訊",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1393,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "接著就提供您各地的氣象資料",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
